<td id="S4.T2.2.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Self-verify</td>
<td id="S4.T2.2.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">✓</td>
