<td id="S7.T6.2.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r">Self-evolving libraries</td>
<td id="S7.T6.2.1.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r">
