<span id="S7.T6.2.1.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Poisoned distillation; skill drift; quality degradation</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S7.T6.2.1.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r">
<span id="S7.T6.2.1.5.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="S7.T6.2.1.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Human-in-the-loop verification; regression testing; anomaly detection</span>
</span></td>
