<span id="S7.T6.2.1.6.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;--ltx-bg-color:#FBF5EC;">
<span id="S7.T6.2.1.6.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Clear NL/code separation; instruction priority rules</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S7.T6.2.1.6.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="S7.T6.2.1.6.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FBF5EC;">Medium</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S7.T6.2.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S7.T6.2.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r">6</td>
<td id="S7.T6.2.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r">Meta-skills</td>
<td id="S7.T6.2.1.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r">
<span id="S7.T6.2.1.7.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:156.5pt;">
<span id="S7.T6.2.1.7.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Recursive error amplification; adversarial skill generation</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S7.T6.2.1.7.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r">
<span id="S7.T6.2.1.7.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="S7.T6.2.1.7.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Generation caps; quality gates at each iteration; diversity checks</span>
</span></td>
